From 144ad2b4fba2c78a66e0bb3eea4c540d9d3611f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:56:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: the /jffs write-for-everyone notice on the review card
 and dashboard

Reaper_Firewall.asp: Security Review card shows RFW_384 (count + first
path, textContent) when review.json carries ww > 0; reset on every
render. Main_ReaperDash.asp: the review bar adds RDSH_117 and the posture
row RDSH_118. 25 packs: RDSH_117, RDSH_118, RFW_384, translated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
